# Python ignores
cat > .gitignore <<'EOF'
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.pyd
.env
.venv
venv/
.idea/
.vscode/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.DS_Store
EOF

# license (if open source)
echo "MIT License" > LICENSE

# dependencies (pick one)
# if you have versions, add them; else keep it minimal for now
cat > requirements.txt <<'EOF'
pandas
statsmodels
EOF

# readme
cat > README.md <<'EOF'
# Decipher XDI — Layer 3 & 4 + PEM

Emotion-Driven Analytics engine: Trend, Momentum, Volatility, Pattern Recognition (Layer 3), QSSI (Layer 4), and Predictive Emotional Modeling (PEM).

## Quickstart
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python your_entrypoint.py
